        <property name="text">
         <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#0e101a; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;To Enable DVS to transmit, first enable the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; color:#0e101a; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt;REC Setting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#0e101a; background-color:transparent;&quot;&gt; checkbox in the Misc tab, then Short-Press the F button on the FT-891 repeatedly until you're in the rec menu. Then, rotate the MULTI function knob to point to PB. Then pressing the MULTI function knob will enable and disable DVS transmission. The CAT protocol for this radio does not provide full control of this feature. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
        </property>
